{"type":"message","id":"b5942deb","parentId":"bf0903df","timestamp":"2026-02-17T17:03:31.875Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Seems like the exec command isn't returning anything. Let me try to understand the environment better. Perhaps I need to look at the project context files. Let me check if there are any files in the workspace that I can read directly.\n\nAccording to the context, my working directory is D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw. Let me try to read the AGENTS.md file to get more context.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me check the system using a different approach - examining the workspace files directly:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4269ce8dbb9540858664f5b7","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":13377,"output":230,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13607,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771347808667}}
